#. ja: プレザントドットパラソル
#. de: blau-weiß gepunktet[a] Sonnenschirm
#. fr: ombrelle bleue à pois
#. column 2: pleasant dot parasols
#. column 8: Should the weather prove so inclement, the skies so heavy with rain, that one is forced to rely upon a parasol, can it truly be called pleasant? (Yes. Just look at the name.) Use to acquire a pleasant dot parasol.
#. column 9: Pleasant Dot Parasol
msgctxt "Item:33037:0:0"
msgid "pleasant dot parasol"
msgstr "зонт в приятный горошек"

#. de: blau-weiß gepunktet[a] Sonnenschirme
#. fr: ombrelles bleues à pois
#. column 0: pleasant dot parasol
#. column 8: Should the weather prove so inclement, the skies so heavy with rain, that one is forced to rely upon a parasol, can it truly be called pleasant? (Yes. Just look at the name.) Use to acquire a pleasant dot parasol.
#. column 9: Pleasant Dot Parasol
msgctxt "Item:33037:0:2"
msgid "pleasant dot parasols"
msgstr "зонты в приятный горошек"

#. ja: アクション「プレザントドットパラソル」を修得する
#. de: Schaltet das Kommando „Blau-weiß gepunkteter Sonnenschirm“ frei.
#. fr: Permet d'obtenir l'action “Ombrelle bleue à pois”.
#. column 0: pleasant dot parasol
#. column 2: pleasant dot parasols
#. column 9: Pleasant Dot Parasol
msgctxt "Item:33037:0:8"
msgid "Should the weather prove so inclement, the skies so heavy with rain, that one is forced to rely upon a parasol, can it truly be called pleasant? (Yes. Just look at the name.) Use to acquire a pleasant dot parasol."
msgstr "В непогоду так и тянет раскрыть зонт. Но можно ли назвать его приятным? Ещё как! Судите сами. Используйте, чтобы получить зонт в приятный горошек."

