#. ja: ロンカの大水蛇？
#. de: Zweitgrößt[a] Schlange[p] von Ronka
#. fr: Grand Serpent marin de Ronka<nbsp>?
#. column 2: Greater Serpents of Ronka
#. column 8: Fishers who succeed in reeling this enigmatic beast in from the waters of Lake Tusi Mek'ta will almost certainly come to regret it. Whether that is due to its supposed likeness to a particular mythological, godlike creature, or simply because of its unnerving appearance depends entirely on the fisher.<br><br>[Suitable for printing on large canvases.]
#. column 9: Greater Serpent of Ronka
msgctxt "Item:33243:0:0"
msgid "Greater Serpent of Ronka"
msgstr "Большой змей Ронки"

