#. ja: 新生祭のガラス絵EX
#. de: exklusiv[a] Jahrestag-Glasgemälde
#. fr: fixé sous verre de la fête de la Commémoration spécial
#. column 2: authentic <i>Sultana's Seven</i> panes
#. column 8: A faithful recreation of the stained glass artwork that adorned the main stage at Ul'dah's Rising festival. The historic moment when Nanamo Ul Namo and her seven most trusted followers confronted a baying crowd and restored peace to the city is captured in all its glory. Those present at the time of the event have described the determined expressions to be particularly authentic. For aesthetic reasons, however, the artist has wisely chosen not to include the angry mob.
#. column 9: Authentic Sultana's Seven
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:33304:0:0"
msgid "authentic <i>Sultana's Seven</i> pane"
msgstr "подлинная панель <i>«Семь султанши»</i>"

#. de: exklusiv[a] Jahrestag-Glasgemälde
#. fr: fixés sous verre de la fête de la Commémoration spéciaux
#. column 0: authentic <i>Sultana's Seven</i> pane
#. column 8: A faithful recreation of the stained glass artwork that adorned the main stage at Ul'dah's Rising festival. The historic moment when Nanamo Ul Namo and her seven most trusted followers confronted a baying crowd and restored peace to the city is captured in all its glory. Those present at the time of the event have described the determined expressions to be particularly authentic. For aesthetic reasons, however, the artist has wisely chosen not to include the angry mob.
#. column 9: Authentic Sultana's Seven
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:33304:0:2"
msgid "authentic <i>Sultana's Seven</i> panes"
msgstr "подлинные панели <i>«Семь султанши»</i>"

#. ja: 気鋭の彫金師ジャ・ベン・ティアが製作した新生祭を記念したガラス絵
#. de: Ein faszinierendes Glasgemälde vom legendären Glasmaler und Goldschmied J'bhen Tia, erschaffen anlässlich des Jahrestages der Wiedergeburt Eorzeas.
#. fr: Une œuvre d'art réalisée par l'orfèvre J'bhen Tia en l'honneur de la fête de la Commémoration.
#. column 0: authentic <i>Sultana's Seven</i> pane
#. column 2: authentic <i>Sultana's Seven</i> panes
#. column 9: Authentic Sultana's Seven
msgctxt "Item:33304:0:8"
msgid "A faithful recreation of the stained glass artwork that adorned the main stage at Ul'dah's Rising festival. The historic moment when Nanamo Ul Namo and her seven most trusted followers confronted a baying crowd and restored peace to the city is captured in all its glory. Those present at the time of the event have described the determined expressions to be particularly authentic. For aesthetic reasons, however, the artist has wisely chosen not to include the angry mob."
msgstr "Точная копия витража, украшавшего главную сцену на празднике Возрождения в Ульде. На ней во всей красе запечатлён исторический миг: Нанамо Ул Намо и семеро её вернейших соратников противостоят ревущей толпе и возвращают городу мир. Те, кто присутствовал при этом, отмечают особую достоверность решительных лиц. Впрочем, из эстетических соображений художник предусмотрительно не стал изображать разъярённую толпу."

#. ja: 新生祭のガラス絵EX
#. de: Exklusives Jahrestag-Glasgemälde
