#. column 2: irregular tomestones of pageantry
#. column 8: One of only a few in existence, this Allagan tomestone contains knowledge of festivities for all manner of occasions, and even some created purely for sudden outbursts of inexplicable merriment.<br><br>Can be exchanged with itinerant moogles for certain items.
#. column 9: Irregular Tomestone of Pageantry
msgctxt "Item:33329:0:0"
msgid "irregular tomestone of pageantry"
msgstr "необычный аллаганский камень празднеств"

