msgstr "Необычный аллаганский камень празднеств"

#. ja: 希少トームストーン:伝承
#. de: ungewöhnlich[a] Allagisch[a] Stein[p] der Tradition
#. fr: mémoquartz inhabituel traditionnel
#. column 2: irregular tomestones of lore
#. column 8: One of only a few in existence, this Allagan tomestone contains knowledge of various events both probable and improbable, intertwining historical fact and flights of fancy to simultaneously amuse and confuse the reader.<br><br>Can be exchanged with itinerant moogles for certain items.
#. column 9: Irregular Tomestone of Lore
msgctxt "Item:33330:0:0"
msgid "irregular tomestone of lore"
msgstr "необычный аллаганский камень преданий"

