#. ja: 方舟の古銭
#. de: Archen-Münze
#. fr: pièce rouillée de l'arche
#. column 2: breach coins
#. column 8: This round bit of metal, discovered within the machines' mind-bending tower, is stamped with the words “The Ark.” At one time, avid and eccentric collectors would have paid a king's ransom for it, but such numismatic baubles have fallen out of style. Glory to mankind.
#. column 9: Breach Coin
msgctxt "Item:33481:0:0"
msgid "breach coin"
msgstr "Монета Прорыва"

#. de: Archen-Münzen
#. fr: pièces rouillées de l'arche
#. column 0: breach coin
#. column 8: This round bit of metal, discovered within the machines' mind-bending tower, is stamped with the words “The Ark.” At one time, avid and eccentric collectors would have paid a king's ransom for it, but such numismatic baubles have fallen out of style. Glory to mankind.
#. column 9: Breach Coin
msgctxt "Item:33481:0:2"
msgid "breach coins"
msgstr "Монеты Прорыва"

#. ja: 希望ノ砲台：「塔」で発見された古銭。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない。人類に栄光あれ
#. de: Eine perfekt runde Münze aus dem Inneren des Paradigmenbrechers. Einst rissen sich Sammler um diese Rarität, doch heutzutage findet man dafür keine Abnehmer mehr.
#. fr: Une vieille pièce de monnaie trouvée dans la tour de la Contingence. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète. Quoi qu'il en soit, gloire à l'humanité.
#. column 0: breach coin
#. column 2: breach coins
#. column 9: Breach Coin
msgctxt "Item:33481:0:8"
msgid "This round bit of metal, discovered within the machines' mind-bending tower, is stamped with the words “The Ark.” At one time, avid and eccentric collectors would have paid a king's ransom for it, but such numismatic baubles have fallen out of style. Glory to mankind. "
msgstr "Эту круглую монету с надписью «Ковчег» нашли в головокружительной башне машин. Когда-то за неё чудаковатые коллекционеры готовы были отдать целое состояние, но сейчас нумизматика вышла из моды. Слава человечеству."

