#. ja: 錆びた甲冑
#. de: rostig[a] Harnisch
#. fr: armure rouillée
#. column 2: rusted suits of armor
#. column 8: Found half-submerged in the sand of the seabed, one cannot but wonder what fate befell its previous owner.
#. column 9: Rusted Suit of Armor
msgctxt "Item:33872:0:0"
