#. column 8: A detailed record of one retainer's path to becoming a desperately sought-after servitor─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Hand over to instantly raise the level of a retainer up to a maximum of 80. (Retainer level cannot exceed current character level in the relevant class/job.)
msgctxt "Item:33915:0:9"
msgid "Tales of Adventure: One Retainer's Journey III"
msgstr "Сказания о приключениях: Путь помощника III"

#. ja: ダークマターG8
#. de: Quantum[p] Grad 8 Dunkelmaterie
#. fr: fragment de matière sombre grade VIII
#. column 2: fragments of grade 8 dark matter
#. column 8: It has recently been discovered that this substance of unknown origin has the faculty to assimilate with other forms of matter, effectively restoring them to their original condition. This specific grade of dark matter has been shown to bond best with precisely crafted items made from high-quality materials.<br><br>[Used to repair equipment for levels 1-100.]
#. column 9: Grade 8 Dark Matter
msgctxt "Item:33916:0:0"
msgid "fragment of grade 8 dark matter"
msgstr "осколок тёмной материи VIII класса"

#. de: Quanten[p] Grad 8 Dunkelmaterie
#. fr: fragments de matière sombre grade VIII
#. column 0: fragment of grade 8 dark matter
#. column 8: It has recently been discovered that this substance of unknown origin has the faculty to assimilate with other forms of matter, effectively restoring them to their original condition. This specific grade of dark matter has been shown to bond best with precisely crafted items made from high-quality materials.<br><br>[Used to repair equipment for levels 1-100.]
#. column 9: Grade 8 Dark Matter
msgctxt "Item:33916:0:2"
msgid "fragments of grade 8 dark matter"
msgstr "осколки тёмной материи VIII класса"

#. ja: 他物質への同化特性を持つ精神感応型物質。グレード8<br>[レベル1～100の装備向け汎用修理材料]
#. de: Diese mysteriöse Substanz kann Materie assimilieren und sämtliche Eigenschaften der kopierten Materie über<shy>nehmen, was sie zu einem perfekten Material für Reparaturen von Aus<shy>rüstungs<shy>gegen<shy>ständen der Stufen 1 bis 100 macht.
#. fr: Un minerai réagissant à l'énergie spirituelle, et qui a des facultés d'assimilation avec d'autres matières. Convient aux équipements de niveau 1 à 100.
#. column 0: fragment of grade 8 dark matter
#. column 2: fragments of grade 8 dark matter
#. column 9: Grade 8 Dark Matter
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:33916:0:8"
msgid "It has recently been discovered that this substance of unknown origin has the faculty to assimilate with other forms of matter, effectively restoring them to their original condition. This specific grade of dark matter has been shown to bond best with precisely crafted items made from high-quality materials.<br><br>[Used to repair equipment for levels 1-100.]"
msgstr "Недавно выяснилось, что это вещество неизвестного происхождения способно сливаться с другими видами материи и возвращать их в исходное состояние. Тёмная материя этого класса лучше всего подходит для ремонта искусно изготовленных предметов из высококачественных материалов.<br><br>[Используется для ремонта экипировки ур. 1–100.]"

